    {
     "text": "Google Calendar",
     "url": "https://www.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE&dates=20261206T190000Z%2F20261206T213000Z&details=4handsSunday+2pm+06dec2026+Kessa+Mefford+%26+Brielle+Perez+virtuoso+pianists%3B+music+begins+3p%3B+POTLUCK+dinner+buffet+107%0D%0A%0D%0A4hands+%26+solo+piano+program+with+a+fellow+professional+of+works+by+Ravel%2C+Poulenc%2C+Faur%C3%A9%2C+Rachmaninov%2C+and+Montez.+This+program+is+about+65+minutes+of+music.++Guests+are+encouraged+to+bring+READY+TO+SERVE+PREPARED+DISH%2Fwine.%0D%0A%0D%0AKessa+Mefford+is%2C+first+and+foremost%2C+a+champion+of+Ravel.+Kessa+performs+everything+he+wrote+for+piano+%E2%80%94+solo%2C+chamber%2C+art+song%2C+and+concerto.+With+his+ear+for+harmony%2C+his+hunger+for+color%2C+and+his+painstaking+craft%2C+his+music+speaks+in+a+way+that+is+deeply+relatable.++Ravel+believed+his+music+already+existed+and+that+his+role+was+only+to+discover+it.+%E2%80%9CWhen+I+play%2C+I+embark+on+my+own+type+of+discovery.+In+practice%2C+I+can+feel+him+composing+%E2%80%94+him+searching+for+the+perfect+chord+as+I+search+for+the+perfect+sound.+In+performance%2C+I+invite+the+audience+to+search+with+us%2C+discovering+together+the+subtle+tensions+and+quiet+brilliance+that+define+his+music.%E2%80%9D+%22An+exceptional+artist+and+so+lovely+and+charming.+Kessa+put+the+music+within+a+context+as+they+played.+Would+host+Kessa+anytime%21%22%0D%0A%0D%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fkessamefford.com%2Fbio%2Findex.html%0D%0A%0D%0ABrielle+Perez+has+performed+on+important+stages+such+as+Alice+Tully+Hall+at+Lincoln+Center%2C+Weill+Recital+Hall+and+Zankel+Hall+at+Carnegie+Hall%2C+Steinway+Hall+in+New+York+City%2C+the+Concertgebouw+in+Amsterdam%2C+the+Mozarteum+in+Salzburg%2C+and+the+Tchaikovsky+Concert+Hall+in+Moscow+among+many+others.+Her+festival+appearances+include+the+Tanglewood+Music+Festival%2C+the+Art+of+Piano+Festival%2C+the+Malaga+International+Piano+Festival+%28FIPMA%29+and+more.+In+Summer+2026%2C+Brielle+will+attend+the+renowned+Aspen+music+Festival+in+the+studio+of+Yoheved+Kaplinsky.++Among+her+recent+engagements%2C+Perez+gave+a+solo+concert+celebrating+her+Puerto+Rican+heritage+at+the+historical+Puerto+Rican+%E2%80%98Pregones+Theater%E2%80%99+in+the+Bronx%2C+New+York.+In+November+2025%2C+she+collaborated+with+the+Juilliard+dance+department+performing+alongside+Nicholas+Britell+with+new+choreography+by+Bobbi+Jene+Smith.+In+the+past+few+years%2C+Perez+has+been+invited+several+times+as+a+featured+artist+.%0D%0A%0D%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.brielleperez.com%2Fabout-4%0D%0A%0D%0APoulenc+%E2%80%94+Sonata+for+4+Hands+%0D%0AMontez+%E2%80%94+Suite+in+Eb%0D%0ARavel+%E2%80%94+Ma+m%C3%A9re+l%E2%80%99Oy%C3%A9%0D%0AFaur%C3%A9+%E2%80%94+Dolly+Suite%0D%0A++--+intermission+--%0D%0ARachmaninov+%E2%80%94+6+Morceaux%2C+Op.+11%0D%0A%0D%0AProgram+2+35-45+minute+sets+with+10-15+min+intermission%3B+arrivals+2-3pm+buffet+open+2pm%2C+music+room+seating+opens+3pm+%26+music+begins.%0D%0A%0D%0AAdvance+payment+PLEASE+%28pay+thru+GroupMuse+%2425%2Bcc+Fee%2C+artists+receive+%2420%29+or+use+Zelle+ID%3A+rix.rox.SOLOX%40verizon.net+%2425noFee+%28artists+receive+full+%2425+with+Zelle+or+PayPal%29%0D%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.me%2FSOLOXtheArtSalon%0D%0APlease+include+attendee+names+in+Zelle+or+PayPal.+NO+CASH%2FNo+Checks+at+EVENT--illegal+in+MD.%0D%0A%0D%0APotLuck+Dinner+Buffet.+Host+will+provide+two+hot+hors+d%27oeuvres+%26+punch+for+potluck+reception+during+intermission+%26+beginning%2C+when+doors+open.+Guests+are+encouraged+to+bring+READY+TO+SERVE+PREPARED+DISH%2Fwine+to+share%2Fpotluck%3B+if+considering+a+sweet%2C+think+about+fruit+instead+of+processed+sugar.+Minimize+flimsy+plastic%2C+always+ends+up+in+my+ocean.++Music+begins+at+3pm%2C+please+be+on+time%2C+2+sets+with+1+short+intermission%2C+rarely+one+longer+set.+Guests+most+welcome+and+encouraged+to+bring+dish%2Fdrink+to+share%2Fpotluck%2C+please+consider+bringing+wine+if+you+use+it.+Stemware%2FIce+Buckets%2FFiltered+Water+Provided.%0D%0A%0D%0AAll+guests+will+be+seated+in+Music+Room+%28opens+at+3pm%29.+Accessibility+note